        "html": "<!--\n  =====================================================================\n  1% | COMPROMISSO INDIVIDUAL  ·  B3 × Hyper Island\n  PAINEL HYPER ISLAND (telão + moderação)\n  ---------------------------------------------------------------------\n  Como usar no Shopify:\n  1. Crie uma página separada e discreta (ex.: /pages/b3-1-porcento-painel).\n     Não linke essa página em nenhum menu.\n  2. Cole TODO este código em uma seção \"Custom Liquid\" do template.\n  3. Preencha o CONFIG abaixo com os MESMOS dados da página do participante\n     e com o link público da página do participante (para o QR code).\n  4. O acesso é protegido por login (Firebase Authentication, e-mail e\n     senha). Sem o Firebase configurado, o painel roda em MODO\n     DEMONSTRAÇÃO e lê as respostas salvas neste mesmo navegador.\n\n  Atalhos: F tela cheia · Q QR code · A ajustar à tela · H esconder barra\n           + / − zoom · Esc fechar · ← → navegar no modo foco · Delete excluir\n  =====================================================================\n-->\n<div id=\"b3pct-painel\"></div>\n\n<template id=\"b3pct-painel-tpl\">\n<style>\n  :host { all: initial; }\n  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  .app {\n    --vibrante: #1818b7;\n    --profundo: #0a0349;\n    --profundo-2: #110a5c;\n    --coral: #f5ba94;\n    --ceu: #dde9f6;\n    --terracota: #ea5744;\n    --display: \"B3 Sans Display\", \"Ubuntu\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    --text: \"B3 Sans Text\", \"Ubuntu\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n    --ease: cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);\n\n    position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 2147483000;\n    background: var(--profundo);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: var(--text);\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .app.idle, .app.idle * { cursor: none !important; }\n  button { font-family: var(--display); cursor: pointer; border: 0; background: none; color: inherit; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }\n  [hidden] { display: none !important; }\n  button:focus { outline: none; }\n  button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--coral); outline-offset: 2px; }\n  svg { display: block; }\n\n  /* ============ LOGIN ============ */\n  .login {\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 85% -10%, rgba(24,24,183,.65), transparent 60%),\n      var(--profundo);\n  }\n  .login .card-login {\n    width: min(420px, 100%); background: #fff; color: var(--profundo);\n    padding: 34px 30px 30px; border-radius: 3px;\n    box-shadow: 0 50px 100px -40px rgba(0,0,0,.7);\n  }\n  .login .brands { color: var(--profundo); }\n  .login h2 { margin-top: 28px; font: 700 26px/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.01em; }\n  .login p.sub { margin-top: 8px; font: 400 14.5px/1.45 var(--text); color: #5d6189; }\n  .login label { display: block; margin-top: 20px; font: 700 11px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--vibrante); }\n  .login input {\n    display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 8px; height: 46px; padding: 0 14px;\n    border: 2px solid #dfe3f0; border-radius: 2px; outline: 0; background: #fff;\n    font: 500 16px/1 var(--text); color: var(--profundo);\n  }\n  .login input:focus { border-color: var(--vibrante); }\n  .login .go {\n    margin-top: 24px; width: 100%; height: 52px; border-radius: 2px;\n    background: var(--vibrante); color: #fff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .login .go:hover { background: var(--profundo); }\n  .login .go:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: progress; }\n  .login .msg { margin-top: 14px; font: 500 13.5px/1.4 var(--text); color: #c0392b; min-height: 1em; }\n\n  /* ============ MARCAS ============ */\n  .brands { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; color: #fff; flex: none; }\n  .brands .b3 { height: 46px; }\n  .brands .b3 svg { height: 100%; width: auto; }\n  .brands .sep { width: 1px; height: 28px; background: currentColor; opacity: .3; }\n  .brands .hi { height: 13px; }\n  .brands .hi svg { height: 100%; width: auto; }\n\n  /* ============ MAIN ============ */\n  .main { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .top {\n    flex: none; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 56px);\n    padding: clamp(18px, 2.4vw, 34px) clamp(20px, 2.8vw, 48px) clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 22px);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);\n  }\n  .top .title { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n  .eyebrow { font: 700 clamp(10px, .75vw, 13px)/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--coral); }\n  .top h1 {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    font: 700 clamp(22px, 2.55vw, 50px)/1.05 var(--display);\n    letter-spacing: -.02em; color: #fff;\n  }\n  .top h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--coral); }\n  .stat { flex: none; text-align: right; }\n  .stat .n { font: 700 clamp(40px, 4.4vw, 86px)/.85 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--coral); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .stat .l { margin-top: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; font: 700 clamp(10px, .75vw, 13px)/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.75); }\n  .live { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #17a048; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(23,160,72,.6); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }\n  .live.off { background: #8b8fb3; animation: none; }\n  @keyframes pulse { 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(23,160,72,0); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(23,160,72,0); } }\n\n  .board { flex: 1; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .board.scroll { overflow: auto; }\n  .board::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; height: 10px; }\n  .board::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255,255,255,.18); border-radius: 10px; }\n  .sizer { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; pointer-events: none; }\n  .world { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; transform-origin: 0 0; transition: transform .6s var(--ease); }\n  .world.instant { transition: none; }\n\n  /* ============ CARDS ============ */\n  .card {\n    position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 300px;\n    color: var(--profundo);\n    cursor: grab; touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none;\n    transition: transform .6s var(--ease);\n    outline: none;\n  }\n  .card.place { transition: none; }\n  .card.dragging { transition: none; cursor: grabbing; }\n  .card .in {\n    position: relative; background: #fff; border-radius: 3px;\n    padding: 24px 24px 20px;\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6);\n    transition: box-shadow .25s, transform .25s;\n  }\n  .card .in::before {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 10px; width: 14px; height: 14px;\n    border: 3px solid var(--acc); border-right: 0; border-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .card .in::after {\n    content: \"\"; position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; width: 14px; height: 14px;\n    border: 3px solid var(--acc); border-left: 0; border-top: 0;\n  }\n  .card.v0 { --acc: var(--vibrante); }\n  .card.v1 { --acc: var(--profundo); } .card.v1 .in { background: var(--coral); }\n  .card.v2 { --acc: var(--vibrante); } .card.v2 .in { background: var(--ceu); }\n  .card.v3 { --acc: var(--coral); color: #fff; } .card.v3 .in { background: var(--vibrante); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.12); }\n\n  .card .txt { font: 500 20px/1.36 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.005em; word-break: break-word; }\n  .card .who { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font: 700 11px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .7; }\n  .card .who::before { content: \"\"; width: 16px; height: 2px; background: currentColor; flex: none; }\n  .card .who:empty { display: none; }\n\n  .card.big { width: 620px; }\n  .card.big .in { padding: 38px 40px 32px; }\n  .card.big .txt { font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.015em; }\n  .card.big .who { font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px; }\n  .card.big .in::before, .card.big .in::after { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-width: 4px; }\n\n  .card:hover .in, .card:focus-visible .in { box-shadow: 0 26px 50px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.7); }\n  .card:focus-visible .in { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--coral), 0 26px 50px -18px rgba(0,0,0,.7); }\n  .card.dragging .in { transform: scale(1.03) rotate(-.6deg); box-shadow: 0 50px 90px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.8); }\n\n  .card.fresh .in { animation: pop .8s var(--ease) backwards; }\n  .card.fresh .in { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--coral), 0 18px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6); transition: box-shadow 1.2s ease 2.2s; }\n  .card.fresh.settled .in { box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6); }\n  @keyframes pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.7) translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }\n  .card.out { pointer-events: none; }\n  .card.out .in { animation: out .35s ease-in forwards; }\n  @keyframes out { to { opacity: 0; transform: scale(.85); } }\n\n  .acts {\n    position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; display: flex; gap: 4px;\n    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); transition: opacity .18s, transform .18s;\n  }\n  .card:hover .acts, .card:focus-within .acts { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\n  .card.dragging .acts { opacity: 0; }\n  .acts button {\n    width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%;\n    display: grid; place-items: center;\n    background: rgba(10,3,73,.1); color: inherit;\n    transition: background .15s, color .15s;\n  }\n  .card.v3 .acts button { background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); }\n  .acts button svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; }\n  .acts button:hover { background: var(--profundo); color: #fff; }\n  .acts button[data-act=\"del\"]:hover { background: var(--terracota); color: #fff; }\n  .card.big .acts button[data-act=\"big\"] { background: var(--profundo); color: var(--coral); }\n\n  /* ============ VAZIO ============ */\n  .empty {\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 72px); padding: 40px 40px 110px; text-align: left;\n  }\n  .empty .qrbox { background: #fff; padding: 16px; border-radius: 3px; flex: none; }\n  .empty .qrbox img { width: clamp(170px, 17vw, 300px); height: auto; display: block; }\n  .empty h3 { font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.6vw, 48px)/1.08 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.02em; max-width: 13em; }\n  .empty p { margin-top: 14px; font: 400 clamp(15px, 1.15vw, 20px)/1.45 var(--text); color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); max-width: 28em; }\n  .empty .url { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; font: 700 clamp(14px, 1.1vw, 20px)/1.2 var(--display); color: var(--coral); word-break: break-all; }\n  .dots { display: inline-flex; gap: 6px; margin-left: 10px; vertical-align: middle; }\n  .dots i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--coral); animation: blink 1.4s infinite both; }\n  .dots i:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .2s; } .dots i:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .4s; }\n  @keyframes blink { 0%, 80%, 100% { opacity: .2; } 40% { opacity: 1; } }\n\n  /* ============ DOCK ============ */\n  .dock {\n    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 18px; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px; padding: 6px;\n    background: rgba(17,10,92,.88);\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px); backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 999px;\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.7);\n    transition: opacity .3s, transform .3s var(--ease);\n    z-index: 5; max-width: calc(100% - 24px); overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;\n  }\n  .dock::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n  .app.idle .dock, .app.nodock .dock { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, 24px); pointer-events: none; }\n  .dock .sep { width: 1px; height: 22px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.15); margin: 0 6px; flex: none; }\n  .dock button {\n    position: relative; height: 40px; min-width: 40px; padding: 0 12px;\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;\n    border-radius: 999px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);\n    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; flex: none;\n    transition: background .15s, color .15s;\n  }\n  .dock button.ico { padding: 0; }\n  .dock button svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex: none; }\n  .dock button:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); color: #fff; }\n  .dock button.on { background: var(--coral); color: var(--profundo); }\n  .dock .zoom { min-width: 48px; text-align: center; font: 700 12px/1 var(--display); color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; flex: none; }\n  .dock .tag { font: 700 10px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--profundo); background: var(--coral); padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 999px; margin: 0 6px; flex: none; }\n  .tip { position: relative; }\n  .tip:hover::after {\n    content: attr(data-tip); position: absolute; bottom: calc(100% + 10px); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: #fff; color: var(--profundo); font: 700 12px/1 var(--display); padding: 7px 9px; border-radius: 3px; white-space: nowrap; pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  /* ============ OVERLAYS ============ */\n  .ovl {\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 10; display: grid; place-items: center;\n    opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: opacity .3s, visibility .3s;\n  }\n  .ovl.open { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }\n\n  /* foco (expandir) */\n  .spot { background: var(--profundo); padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 90px); }\n  .spot .stage { width: min(1400px, 100%); display: flex; align-items: stretch; transform: scale(.96); transition: transform .4s var(--ease); }\n  .spot.open .stage { transform: none; }\n  .spot .br { flex: none; width: clamp(28px, 3vw, 56px); border: clamp(8px, .9vw, 16px) solid var(--coral); }\n  .spot .br.l { border-right: 0; } .spot .br.r { border-left: 0; }\n  .spot .body { flex: 1; padding: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 64px) clamp(20px, 3vw, 56px); min-width: 0; }\n  .spot .eyebrow { margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 2vw, 32px); }\n  .spot .txt { font: 700 clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 92px)/1.12 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.025em; color: #fff; word-break: break-word; }\n  .spot .txt.m { font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 72px); }\n  .spot .txt.s { font-size: clamp(22px, 2.8vw, 58px); line-height: 1.18; }\n  .spot .who { margin-top: clamp(18px, 2.2vw, 40px); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font: 700 clamp(13px, 1.2vw, 22px)/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--coral); }\n  .spot .who::before { content: \"\"; width: 34px; height: 3px; background: currentColor; }\n  .spot .who:empty { display: none; }\n  .spot .bar { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px clamp(20px, 3vw, 48px) 22px; transition: opacity .3s; }\n  .app.idle .spot .bar { opacity: 0; }\n  .spot .idx { font: 700 14px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: .14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .spot .ctl { display: flex; gap: 8px; }\n  .spot .ctl button {\n    height: 46px; min-width: 46px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 999px;\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;\n    transition: background .15s, color .15s;\n  }\n  .spot .ctl button svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }\n  .spot .ctl button:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.18); }\n  .spot .ctl button.on { background: var(--coral); color: var(--profundo); }\n  .spot .ctl button.danger:hover { background: var(--terracota); }\n  .spot .nav { position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); color: #fff; transition: background .15s, opacity .3s; }\n  .spot .nav:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); }\n  .spot .nav svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; }\n  .spot .nav.prev { left: clamp(8px, 1.4vw, 24px); } .spot .nav.next { right: clamp(8px, 1.4vw, 24px); }\n  .app.idle .spot .nav { opacity: 0; }\n\n  /* QR */\n  .qr { background: rgba(10,3,73,.94); }\n  .qr .panel { background: #fff; color: var(--profundo); border-radius: 3px; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 48px); display: flex; gap: clamp(24px, 3vw, 56px); align-items: center; max-width: calc(100% - 40px); transform: translateY(14px); transition: transform .4s var(--ease); }\n  .qr.open .panel { transform: none; }\n  .qr img { width: clamp(220px, 26vw, 460px); height: auto; display: block; }\n  .qr h3 { font: 700 clamp(26px, 2.8vw, 54px)/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.02em; max-width: 9em; }\n  .qr p { margin-top: 14px; font: 400 clamp(15px, 1.2vw, 20px)/1.4 var(--text); color: #5d6189; }\n  .qr .url { margin-top: 18px; font: 700 clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 24px)/1.2 var(--display); color: var(--vibrante); word-break: break-all; }\n  .qr .missing { max-width: 420px; }\n  .x { position: absolute; top: 18px; right: 18px; width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); color: #fff; }\n  .x:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.2); }\n  .x svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }\n\n  /* confirmação */\n  .conf { background: rgba(10,3,73,.7); }\n  .conf .panel { width: min(440px, calc(100% - 40px)); background: #fff; color: var(--profundo); border-radius: 3px; padding: 30px; }\n  .conf h3 { font: 700 22px/1.15 var(--display); }\n  .conf p { margin-top: 10px; font: 400 15px/1.5 var(--text); color: #5d6189; }\n  .conf .row { margin-top: 24px; display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; }\n  .conf .row button { height: 44px; padding: 0 18px; border-radius: 2px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .conf .cancel { background: #eef1f8; color: var(--profundo); }\n  .conf .ok { background: var(--vibrante); color: #fff; }\n\n  /* toast */\n  .toast {\n    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 84px; z-index: 20;\n    transform: translate(-50%, 16px); opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;\n    background: #fff; color: var(--profundo); padding: 12px 12px 12px 18px; border-radius: 3px;\n    font: 500 14px/1.3 var(--text); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.7);\n    transition: opacity .25s, transform .25s var(--ease);\n  }\n  .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); pointer-events: auto; }\n  .toast button { height: 34px; padding: 0 14px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--profundo); color: var(--coral); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .toast button:empty { display: none; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .top { flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }\n    .top .title { order: 3; flex-basis: 100%; }\n    .stat { margin-left: auto; }\n    .brands .b3 { height: 34px; }\n    .dock button .lb { display: none; }\n    .dock button { padding: 0; }\n    .qr .panel { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }\n    .empty { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <!-- LOGIN -->\n  <section class=\"login\" hidden=\"\">\n    <form class=\"card-login\" novalidate=\"\">\n      <div class=\"brands\">\n        <span class=\"b3\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"B3\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 2983 2559\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fi